# cron alternative to launchd (Linux / macOS without launchd).
#
# Install with:  crontab -e
# then paste the lines below, replacing /path/to/JobAppTracker-Gmail2Offers
# with the repo location on your machine.
#
# Scan Gmail + rebuild the board every hour, at 20 past the hour.
# Logs: <repo>/logs/scan-YYYYMMDD.log
20 * * * * /bin/bash /path/to/JobAppTracker-Gmail2Offers/scripts/run_scan.sh

# Serve the local dashboard (alternative to the launchd server agent).
# Run once in a terminal, or add to your shell startup:
#   python3 -m http.server 8765 --directory /path/to/JobAppTracker-Gmail2Offers/web
# then open http://localhost:8765/index.html#preview
